  "prefLabel": "Plu 307.07 Effect of The Signature",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plu 307.07 Effect of The Signature. The effect of the signature required by Plu 307.06(b) shall be:\n\n(a) To make the signer responsible for the compliance of the business entity with RSA 329-A and the administrative rules of the board; and\n\n(b) If the business entity, once certified, fails in such compliance, to subject both the business entity and the signer to sanction for misconduct.\n\nSource. #8981, eff 9-20-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plu100-500.html"
}
